n class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hey, come in! How are you? How are the renovations coming along?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I got someone to put in a bay window in the front, but other than that they are happening slowly.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A bay window! How nice! These house problems seem to be contagious. Now, I'm having a few issues of my own!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're kidding!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come over here and check this out.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no! That is a huge stain!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The rain is seeping into the house because the shingles on the roof are peeling off.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le01ob06e2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should have a roofer look at that right away! You will definitely have to get someone to repair it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah. First I thought I might try to look at it more closely myself.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, let's get out the ladder and inspect the roof.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are you going up the ladder?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Okay, tell me exactly what you see.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am trying to figure out where this enormous gaping hole came from. Come and take a look.", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le01ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Okay. Geez. It looks like I have to get a professional to assess what's happening here. In the meantime we are going to the hardware store to get a tarp so the rain can't get in. We'll get Peter to help us put it on the roof.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm afraid I can't stay right now because I'm having Anna cut my hair at 3. I hope you and Peter can manage.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course we can.  With my tool box and Peter's help, we'll know what to do.", "id": 3, "time": "61000", "image": "engenn9le01ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob06e2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}